1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =
2 CONT '''SECOND WIFE OF CARL MODIG'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Married In Bjurholm ́s Parish June 29, 1882 to Wendla Maria Henrietta  Amnéus. She was born in Bjurholm ́s Parish May 22, 1861 and  died in Härnösand October 26, 1946. She was a daughter of the  vicar at Nätra Parish Per Erik Amné
2 CONC us and his wife Clara Henrietta Borgström.  Carl and Vendla Amneus had 12 children, all born in Harnosand.
