1 NAME Fredrik /Björkebaum/
2 GIVN Fredrik
2 SURN Björkebaum
2 _MARNM Björkebaum
2 NICK Björkebom
2 NICK Fredrich
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 9 SEP 1734
2 ADDR
3 CITY Bispgården
