1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Marriage on 3 October 1790 with Elisabet Andersdotter (1768-1829)
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1811, Nils Isaacsson received permission to survey a new farm plot in Bastuträsk because the old plot was disturbed and damaged during the thaw. On January 21, 1815, Nils left his homestead 1/4 mtl to the second oldest son Ande
2 CONC rs.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: "Bastuträsk - Gunnarn 250 years 1743-1993"
2 CONT
