2 CONT Was a farmer (bonde) at  Bäck 1, like his father. Three of his younger brothers died on same battlefield in War of 1702.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Kurt Andersson,https://www.qhurth.com/anor/0001/39613.htm
