1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The first to call himself Norenius in Gideå was Lars Norenius who was born in 1807 in Västergissjö and died in 1877 in Sunnansjö. From the beginning, his name was Lars Persson, but in connection with his marriage t
2 CONC o Anna Catharina Persdotter, he changed his name to Norenius. This first Lars Norenius was the great-grandfather of Hembygdsforskaren and Genealogist Kjell Norenius from Sunnansjö in Gideå.
